}

CustomCallArityPlain {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' takes {1} argument(s) in the HLSL it becomes, but this call passes {2}."
    text  "'{0}' 生成的 HLSL 接受 {1} 个实参，但这次调用传入了 {2} 个。"
    state machine
}

CustomCallCycle {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "The '@custom' functions {0} call each other in a cycle; HLSL has no recursion, so their bodies cannot be embedded in a custom node."
    text  "'@custom' 函数 {0} 相互循环调用；HLSL 不支持递归，因此它们的函数体无法嵌入 Custom 节点。"
    state machine
}

CustomCallVoidValue {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' returns nothing in the HLSL it becomes, so this call has no value to read; pass a variable for each of its 'out' parameters and read those."
    text  "'{0}' 生成的 HLSL 没有返回值，这次调用没有可读取的值；请为它的每个 'out' 参数传入一个变量，再读取这些变量。"
    state machine
}

CustomCallsGraphFunction {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' is not a '@custom' function and cannot be called from the HLSL body of '{1}'; a custom node sees no graph values, so mark '{0}' '@custom' as well or move the call out of the body."
    text  "'{0}' 不是 '@custom' 函数，不能在 '{1}' 的 HLSL 函数体中调用；Custom 节点看不到图中的值，因此请把 '{0}' 也标为 '@custom'，或把这个调用移出函数体。"
    state machine
}

CustomCallsHoistingFunction {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' takes the 'UE.' calls lifted out of its body as inputs of its own custom node, so the HLSL body of '{1}' cannot call it; call it from a graph body instead."
    text  "'{0}' 会把从函数体中提升出来的 'UE.' 调用作为它自己 Custom 节点的输入，所以 '{1}' 的 HLSL 函数体不能调用它；请改在图函数体中调用。"
    state machine
}

CustomCaseOnlyMatch {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' differs from the function '{1}' only in case; HLSL is case-sensitive, so this call is left for the shader compiler. Did you mean '{1}'?"
    text  "'{0}' 与函数 '{1}' 只有大小写不同；HLSL 区分大小写，因此这个调用留给着色器编译器处理。你是不是想写 '{1}'？"
    state machine
}

CustomDuplicateParameterName {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' declares '{1}' twice in the HLSL it generates; a texture parameter also claims '{1}Sampler', which the engine declares alongside it."
    text  "'{0}' 在它生成的 HLSL 中两次声明了 '{1}'；纹理参数还会占用 '{1}Sampler' 这个名字，引擎会在声明纹理的同时声明它。"
