    text  "'{0}' 中有一个路径为空的 '#include'；请写出头文件所在的虚拟着色器路径，例如 \"/Engine/Private/Common.ush\"。"
    state machine
}

CustomHoistedRange {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
    src   "'{0}' lifts the call behind its input '{1}' out of a place its body does not have, so its custom node's code cannot be built."
    text  "'{0}' 提升其输入 '{1}' 背后的调用时，指向了函数体中不存在的位置，因此无法生成它的 Custom 节点代码。"
    state machine
}

CustomInoutParameter {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRCustomHlsl.cpp
